Upstream's unit file starts the binary from /usr/local/bin, where it is
installed when it is built by hand. In the RPM the binary lives in
/usr/bin, so the path has to be fixed.

--- a/resources/xwayland-satellite.service
+++ b/resources/xwayland-satellite.service
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
 [Service]
 Type=notify
 NotifyAccess=all
-ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/xwayland-satellite
+ExecStart=/usr/bin/xwayland-satellite
 StandardOutput=journal
 
 [Install]
